      Cf. Oráculos <i>sibil. </i>5:143.159; <i>Baruc siríaco </i>67:7; 1 Pe 5:13. — 22 Is 21:1-9; Jer 50:1-51:64. — 23 Dan 
      4:27. — 24 Jer 51:7-8. — 25 Ap 17:1ss. — 26 Is 21:9-10; cf. Jer 50:2. — 27 
      Cf. Is 51:17:22; Jer 51:7. — 28 E. B. Allo, o.c. p.239. — 29 Cf. S. 
