      — 47 Ap 7:1-17- — 48 Ap 10:1-11:14. — 49 Cf. J. Jeremías, &quot;Ap &#924;&#945;&#947;&#949;&#948;&#974;&#957;, en <i>
      Teologisches Worterbuch zum &#925;. &#932;. </i>&#921; p.467-468; C. Watzinger,
      <i>Tell el-Mutesellim </i>(Leipzig 1929); C. Fischer, <i>The Excavation of 
      Armagedon </i>(Chicago 1929); P. Guy, <i>New Lightfrom Armageddon </i>
